# ── Frontend environment variables ────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# VITE_API_URL — where the frontend sends API requests.
#
# LOCAL DEV:
#   Leave EMPTY — the Vite dev-server proxy (configured in vite.config.ts)
#   forwards /api requests to the backend running on localhost:5001.
#
# DOCKER (Hugging Face Spaces):
#   Leave EMPTY — the backend serves both the API and the built frontend
#   from the same origin, so the relative /api fallback works correctly.
#
# NETLIFY / VERCEL (frontend hosted separately from backend):
#   Set to the full backend URL including /api prefix, e.g.:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://your-space-name.hf.space/api
#   Set this in the Netlify/Vercel build environment — their UI-set
#   variables override this file at build time.
#
VITE_API_URL=
